{"seq":4,"slug":"data-analytics-engineering","title":"数据分析与工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.23,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.92,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据分析与工程-简介\">数据分析与工程 简介</h1><p>数据分析与工程是每一位现代软件开发者都应当掌握的核心能力。随着数据驱动决策在企业中的普及，程序员不再仅仅是代码的编写者，更是数据价值链中不可或缺的参与者。无论你是前端工程师、后端开发者还是全栈工程师，理解数据从采集、存储、处理到分析和决策的完整链路，都将极大地提升你的技术视野和职业竞争力。</p>\n<p>本手册面向希望系统学习数据分析与数据工程能力的程序员。你不需要有统计学或数据科学的专业背景，只需具备基本的编程能力和对数据的好奇心。手册将从程序员最熟悉的 SQL 出发，逐步引导你构建完整的数据能力体系。</p>\n<p>通过本手册，你将学到如何编写高效的分析型 SQL 查询，如何将原始数据转化为直观的可视化图表，如何设计科学的埋点体系来采集用户行为数据，如何理解数据仓库的架构与设计思想，如何定义和拆解关键业务指标，以及如何在团队中推动数据驱动的工程文化。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>开发者 SQL</strong>从窗口函数、CTE 和查询优化入手，帮助你从&quot;能写 SQL&quot;进阶到&quot;写好 SQL&quot;。你将学会执行计划分析、索引策略选择以及面向分析场景的 SQL 编写模式，包括留存分析、漏斗查询和队列分析等经典数据分析范式。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>数据可视化</strong>系统讲解从可视化原则到工具选型的完整知识。Edward Tufte 的经典设计原则、图表类型的适用场景分析、仪表盘布局设计以及主流可视化工具的对比评估，将帮助你把数据转化为可被理解和行动的视觉信息。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>埋点设计</strong>深入用户行为数据采集的工程实践。从事件模型和属性设计的基础概念，到埋点方案的规范制定和 Review 流程，再到数据质量保障和隐私合规要求，这一章将让你理解数据源头的质量决定了整个数据链路的上限。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>数据仓库基础</strong>带你走进数据存储和处理的核心领域。Lambda 与 Kappa 架构的设计取舍、ETL 流水线的工程实践、OLAP 引擎的原理与选型，以及数据湖与 Lakehouse 的前沿架构，这些知识将帮助你理解数据基础设施的全貌。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>业务指标</strong>聚焦于数据分析的最终目的——驱动业务决策。你将学会如何定义北极星指标并构建指标树，如何科学计算留存率和变现指标，以及如何建立增长实验框架来量化产品迭代的效果。</p>\n<p>第六章<strong>数据驱动文化</strong>从组织和文化的视角审视数据能力建设。全员数据素养的培养、实验文化的建立、数据治理体系的搭建以及数据团队的组织模式，这些软性能力往往是企业数据化转型成败的决定性因素。</p>\n<p>推荐的学习路径是按章节顺序推进。如果你的日常工作已涉及数据查询，可以从第一章快速过渡到第三章的埋点设计，然后回头补充第二章的可视化知识。如果你更关注架构层面的理解，第四章可以优先阅读。无论选择哪条路径，第五章和第六章都建议放在最后，因为它们需要前四章的技术基础作为支撑。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sql-for-developers","title":"开发者 SQL","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/sql-for-developers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"advanced-queries","title":"高级查询：窗口函数、CTE、子查询优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/sql-for-developers/advanced-queries"},{"seq":2,"slug":"query-optimization","title":"查询优化：执行计划分析、索引策略、慢查询诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/sql-for-developers/query-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-modeling","title":"数据建模：范式设计、星型/雪花模型、维度建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/sql-for-developers/data-modeling"},{"seq":4,"slug":"sql-for-analytics","title":"分析 SQL：留存分析、漏斗查询、队列分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/sql-for-developers/sql-for-analytics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-visualization","title":"数据可视化","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-visualization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"visualization-principles","title":"可视化原则：Edward Tufte 原则、数据墨水比、图表选择决策树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-visualization/visualization-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chart-types","title":"图表类型：柱状/折线/散点/热力图/桑基图的适用场景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-visualization/chart-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dashboard-design","title":"仪表盘设计：布局原则、信息密度、交互设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-visualization/dashboard-design"},{"seq":4,"slug":"visualization-tools","title":"可视化工具：D3.js / ECharts / Grafana / Metabase / Superset 对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-visualization/visualization-tools"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"event-tracking-design","title":"埋点设计","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/event-tracking-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tracking-fundamentals","title":"埋点基础：事件模型、属性设计、埋点分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/event-tracking-design/tracking-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tracking-plan","title":"埋点方案设计：埋点文档规范、命名规范、Review 流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/event-tracking-design/tracking-plan"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-quality","title":"数据质量：数据校验、异常检测、数据修复策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/event-tracking-design/data-quality"},{"seq":4,"slug":"privacy-compliance","title":"隐私合规：GDPR/CCPA 合规、用户同意管理、数据脱敏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/event-tracking-design/privacy-compliance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-warehouse-basics","title":"数据仓库基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-warehouse-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dw-architecture","title":"数仓架构：Lambda/Kappa 架构、分层设计（ODS/DWD/DWS/ADS）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-warehouse-basics/dw-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"etl-pipeline","title":"ETL 流水线：数据抽取/转换/加载、调度系统、增量处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-warehouse-basics/etl-pipeline"},{"seq":3,"slug":"olap-basics","title":"OLAP 基础：OLAP vs OLTP、多维分析、ClickHouse/Doris/StarRocks","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-warehouse-basics/olap-basics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-lake","title":"数据湖：数据湖 vs 数据仓库、Lakehouse 架构、Iceberg/Hudi","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-warehouse-basics/data-lake"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"business-metrics","title":"业务指标","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/business-metrics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"north-star-metrics","title":"北极星指标：如何定义北极星指标、指标树分解、输入/输出指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/business-metrics/north-star-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"retention-analysis","title":"留存分析：DAU/MAU/留存率计算、留存曲线、提升策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/business-metrics/retention-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"monetization-metrics","title":"变现指标：LTV/CAC/ARPU/ARPPU、付费率、ROI 分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/business-metrics/monetization-metrics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"growth-metrics","title":"增长指标：病毒系数、K-Factor、增长飞轮、增长实验框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/business-metrics/growth-metrics"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"data-driven-culture","title":"数据驱动文化","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-driven-culture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-literacy","title":"数据素养：全员数据素养培养、数据民主化、自助分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-driven-culture/data-literacy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"experiment-culture","title":"实验文化：假设驱动、实验框架、失败容忍度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-driven-culture/experiment-culture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-governance","title":"数据治理：数据目录、数据血缘、数据所有权、数据 SLA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-driven-culture/data-governance"},{"seq":4,"slug":"analytics-organization","title":"分析组织：集中式/嵌入式/混合式数据团队、数据中台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-driven-culture/analytics-organization"}]}]}